Observation:
- CGEvent with CGEventKeyboardSetUnicodeString preserves 100% of Unicode characters.
- osascript keystroke replaces accented Vietnamese characters with unaccented approximations
  (e.g., Tiếng -> Tiang, Việt -> Viat, có dấu -> ca dau, Trăm -> Tram, chữ -> cha).
